  "boundary": "Synthetic identity-capable worker speaks real WorkerApi but executes no process. Owned gated StoreDriver task models an external request surviving coordinator-future cancellation; provider behavior itself is not qualified. Restart is graceful coordinator shutdown/journal reopen, not abrupt OS process crash or replicated failover. Local listener mounts all APIs without deployment auth isolation. Memory sink persists only for fixture lifetime. No M6 latest-head, accepted-history relocation, production cutover, listener security, or physical durability claim.",
